 n</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"katex math inline\">1 \\leq s_i \\leq n</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"katex math inline\">k_i \\geq 1</span> 且 <span class=\"katex math inline\">\\sum k_i \\leq 10^5</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"katex math inline\">1 \\leq |a_{i,j}| \\leq n</span></li>\n</ul></div>\n\n                    \n                </div>",
